[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ヴァレリアー！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "レスナじゃねぇか。どうした？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh, if it isn't Resna. What's up?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ランツェ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lanze"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "こんにちは。今日は「星の繭」に食事に行かないか、\nヴァレリアを誘おうと思って……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hello. I was thinking of inviting Valeria to eat at the Star's Cocoon..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "おう。ヴァレリア、行ってきたらどうだ？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hey, that sounds nice. Valeria, why don't you go with her?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ランツェ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lanze"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "私……ちょっと身体を動かしたいから。\n山に出かけてくる",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I... want to get some exercise. I'm heading to the mountains."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あ……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "毎日来てもらってんのに悪いな",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sorry about that. She keeps turning you down even though you visit every day."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ランツェ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lanze"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あいつも色々、不安なんだろう。\nあんまり責めないでやってくれ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "She's probably dealing with a lot of uncertainty right now. Try not to take it personally."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ランツェ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lanze"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "いえ……私のせいです。\nヴァレリアの都合も考えないから……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "No... it's my fault. I wasn't considering her feelings..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "まぁ、気楽に待ってやってくれよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Well, just take it easy and give her time."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ランツェ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lanze"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はい……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "バーバラよぅ、こういうとき、なんて言ってやるのが\n一番いいんだろうな……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Barbara, what would you say at a time like this..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ランツェ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lanze"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はぁ……私、何してるんだろ……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "*sigh* What am I doing..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（ヴァレリアに避けられるようになっちゃった……）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Valeria's been avoiding me...)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（記憶が無くなることは、覚悟してた。\n\u3000私への作られた好意が無くなったことも）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(I was prepared for her losing her memories. Even for her forced feelings for me to disappear.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（でも、やっぱり辛いよ……）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(But it still hurts...)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（どうしたら……また仲良くなれるんだろう）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(How can I... get close to her again?)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あれ。レスナ、ヴァレリアと一緒に来るって\n言ってなかったっけ？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Huh? Didn't you say you were coming with Valeria?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ライザ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "それが、断られてしまいまして……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Well, she turned me down..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……ヴァレリア、まだ相変わらず？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Still the same with Valeria?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ライザ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はい……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そっか……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I see..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ライザ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ごめんね、レスナ。「きっと元通りになる」だなんて\n無責任なこと言っちゃって",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I'm sorry, Resna. I shouldn't have carelessly said that everything will go back to normal."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ライザ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そ、そんな！\u3000ライザ先輩が謝る必要なんて……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "N-no! You don't need to apologize, Miss Ryza..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あたしも、できることはなんでも手伝うからさ。\nあんまり、一人で抱え込んじゃダメだよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I'll help however I can, okay? Don't try to handle everything by yourself."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ライザ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そんなことは……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That's not..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "その顔を見れば分かるよ。\nぜんぜん余裕ないって顔してる",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I can tell by your face. You're really struggling with this."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ライザ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "話がしたくなったら、いつでも聞くから。\n無理しないでね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "If you ever need to talk, I'm here. Don't push yourself too hard."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ライザ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "私、そんな顔してたんだ……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Was it that obvious on my face..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（ヴァレリアだって、記憶を無くして不安なはず）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Valeria must be anxious too, having lost her memories.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（私、自分のことばかりで、ヴァレリアの気持ちを\n\u3000ちゃんと考えられていなかったのかも）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(I've been so wrapped up in my own feelings, I haven't properly considered how Valeria feels.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 31,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（焦ったからって、ヴァレリアの記憶が\n\u3000戻るわけじゃない）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Being impatient won't bring her memories back.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 32,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（「急がば回れ」って、イザナちゃんも言ってた）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Like Izana always says, 'more haste, less speed.')"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 33,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（少し距離を置いてみるのも悪くない、かも）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Maybe giving her some space isn't such a bad idea.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 34,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……そういえば今度、\n王様に謁見するよう言われてたっけ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Come to think of it, I was summoned for an audience with His Majesty."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 35,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "私の夢に向けての大きな一歩……\n中途半端な気持ちじゃダメだ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "This is a big step toward my dream... I can't face it half-heartedly."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 36,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "気持ちを切り替えて、\n錬金術の腕も、もっともっと磨かなきゃ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Time to focus and work even harder on my alchemy!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]